OL,3,AStrictly's new presenters - after
OL,4,Afrosty reviews have they warmed up?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrictly Come Dancing's new hosting
OL,7,Ftrio received a very mixed reception
OL,8,Fwhen the latest series began a month
OL,9,Fago. Ratings have dipped and the jury's
OL,10,Fstill out, but critics say they are
OL,11,Fslowly getting into the groove.
OL,13,FChanging the hosting team on the BBC's
OL,14,Fflagship Saturday night entertainment
OL,15,Fshow was never likely to be a waltz in
OL,16,Fthe park.
OL,18,FAnd going from two presenters to three,
OL,19,Fand giving them slightly different
OL,20,Froles, upset the show's rhythm even
OL,21,Fmore.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
